# VS Code (REST Client eklentisi) veya Visual Studio'da istekleri tek tikla gondermek icin.
# Sirayla calistirin: register -> token'i asagidaki @token'a yapistirin -> digerleri.

@host = http://localhost:5182/api
@token = BURAYA_ACCESS_TOKEN
@roomTypeId = BURAYA_ODA_TIPI_ID
@roomId = BURAYA_ODA_ID
@reservationId = BURAYA_REZERVASYON_ID

### Otel kaydi (otel + sahibi)
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hotelName": "Güneş Butik Otel",
  "city": "Antalya",
  "ownerFullName": "Hülya Güneş",
  "ownerEmail": "owner@gunes.test",
  "password": "Parola123!"
}

### Giris
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "owner@gunes.test", "password": "Parola123!" }

### Token yenileme
POST {{host}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "accessToken": "{{token}}", "refreshToken": "BURAYA_REFRESH_TOKEN" }

### Otel bilgisi
GET {{host}}/hotel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Resepsiyon kullanicisi ekle (sadece Owner)
POST {{host}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Resepsiyon", "email": "resepsiyon@gunes.test", "password": "Parola123!", "role": "Reception" }

### Oda tipi olustur
POST {{host}}/room-types
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Deniz Manzarali", "description": "Balkonlu", "capacity": 3, "basePrice": 2000 }

### Sezon fiyati
POST {{host}}/room-types/{{roomTypeId}}/seasonal-prices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "startDate": "2027-06-01", "endDate": "2027-08-31", "pricePerNight": 3000 }

### Oda olustur
POST {{host}}/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roomNumber": "201", "floor": 2, "roomTypeId": "{{roomTypeId}}" }

### Musaitlik
GET {{host}}/availability?checkIn=2027-07-10&checkOut=2027-07-13&guests=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Rezervasyon
POST {{host}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": "{{roomId}}",
  "checkIn": "2027-07-10",
  "checkOut": "2027-07-13",
  "guestCount": 2,
  "guest": { "fullName": "Ayşe Yılmaz", "email": "ayse@test.com", "phone": "5551112233" }
}

### Rezervasyon listesi (takvim araligi)
GET {{host}}/reservations?from=2027-07-01&to=2027-08-01
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Onayla
POST {{host}}/reservations/{{reservationId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Iptal
POST {{host}}/reservations/{{reservationId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
